    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Based on the performance and data for the year 2007 and 2008, Aga Khan University won the 6th Annual Environmental Excellence Award 2009 at a ceremony held in Karachi on July 9, 2009. The Award is organised each year by the National Forum for Environment & Health in collaboration with United Nations Environment Program (UNEP).",
